msgid "Cada intento de envío de un evento a una URL de webhook genera un registro de entrega (delivery). El registro tiene estados: pending, success o failed. En caso de fallo, Jobcelis reintenta automáticamente con backoff exponencial."
msgstr "Each event delivery attempt to a webhook URL generates a delivery record. The record has states: pending, success, or failed. On failure, Jobcelis automatically retries with exponential backoff."

